          "text": "Description: During the night of August 12 to 13, 1994, between 1:00 and 1:30 a.m., four witnesses reported observing a spinning white ball along the road for approximately 14 km. The investigation quickly demonstrated that it was the observation of a \"skyrose\" laser projector being tested by a nightclub located about 6 km from the observation site.",
